      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "People in Singapore can connect their Muse to apps they already use, including Gmail, Google Calendar and Instagram, so it can help them manage email, coordinate schedules and draw on saved content to get everyday tasks done.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/muse-is-now-available-in-singapore-the-worlds-first-personal-ai-agent-built-for-everyone/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:05.687Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Early local connector partners in Singapore include Shopee, Grab, Singapore Airlines, Agoda, ShopBack, Klook, Trip.com and Lazada spanning shopping, groceries, dining and travel.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/muse-is-now-available-in-singapore-the-worlds-first-personal-ai-agent-built-for-everyone/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:05.687Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Connector features will roll out progressively, with some experiences becoming available after launch.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/muse-is-now-available-in-singapore-the-worlds-first-personal-ai-agent-built-for-everyone/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:05.687Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can ask Muse to research products and compare prices before buying on Shopee or Lazada, or plan grocery shopping and dining through GrabMart and Grab Dine Out.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/muse-is-now-available-in-singapore-the-worlds-first-personal-ai-agent-built-for-everyone/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:05.687Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse runs on Muse Secure VM , a dedicated computer in the cloud that securely stores the data and credentials for the services you connect, while keeping passwords and payment methods out of the agent’s view.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/muse-is-now-available-in-singapore-the-worlds-first-personal-ai-agent-built-for-everyone/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:05.687Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Nicole Tan, Managing Director, Meta Singapore said: “Muse is your personal agent, built to help make everyday life easier.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/muse-is-now-available-in-singapore-the-worlds-first-personal-ai-agent-built-for-everyone/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
